  repeatQuestionMessage: Do you want to repeat and beat your high score? Press repeat
    to repeat or press next  to continue.
  repeatLessonMessage: You have finished lesson 1 sounds around. Do you want to repeat
    the lesson? Press repeat to repeat the lesson or press next to begin the quiz.
  repeatLessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb1703c4d3aad5647bedaee8c8ac303a, type: 3}
  lessonPages:
  - title: 
    lessonText: Welcome to Lesson 1, Sounds Around.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8665fdea5bd96549b6b7d225ed1c27c, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: 'In this lesson you''re going to learn sounds that is produced around
      you. '
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68fc8b3c7e7725f49970d03f2943414c, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Every day, we hear many different sounds around us. These sounds
      help us understand what is happening even when we cannot see. Listening carefully
      helps us stay safe and learn about our surroundings.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2668391df097f274dba2370c98cf262a, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Some sounds come from animals. Some sounds come from people. Other
      sounds come from objects and vehicles. By listening carefully, you can recognize
      and identify these sounds.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f0ceb2a7a7ce4c4b8caa1b4aaa74234, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: You may hear a dog barking, a cat meowing, birds singing, a car honking,
      a telephone ringing, water flowing, rain falling, or a door knocking. These
      are examples of sounds we hear every day.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 18327a13bbcf94c4297fcdde7d7db4f9, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: When you listen carefully, you can identify where a sound comes from.
      This skill helps you move safely, communicate with others, and understand your
      environment.
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4c038b19117b1b4a92ecb2954871810, type: 3}
  - title: 
    lessonText: Now it is your turn. To see whether you know some of this sound Let's
      have a brief quiz. Listen carefully to each sound. Think about what you hear,
      then choose the correct answer using your Braille controller. Take your time
      and do your best. Good luck!
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    lessonAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c66d45fb3b8da894b90dd5949702eb28, type: 3}
